<title>USA: MBIA says qualified some Orange Cty Pension Series.</title>
<headline>MBIA says qualified some Orange Cty Pension Series.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it had qualified a limited supply of Orange County Pension Obligation Series A bonds for secondary market insurance.</p>
<p>MBIA's secondary market insurance for these bonds, dated 9/1/1994, is available on a first-come/first-served basis.</p>
<p>For more information, please call 1-800-624-2669</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
